## 一、定义 / 1. Definitions

**本软件**：指以本仓库（https://github.com/minmindme/Genesis）形式发布的 Genesis 同构数据引擎的全部内容及其后续版本，包括但不限于：源代码、构建产物、文档（白皮书、更新日志、语义规格、展示页）、SQL 脚本、测试用例、前端资产、图标与文本。

**THE SOFTWARE**: The entire contents of the Genesis Isomorphic Data Engine as published in this repository (https://github.com/minmindme/Genesis) and any subsequent versions, including but not limited to: source code, build artifacts, documentation (whitepaper, update log, semantic specification, showcase), SQL scripts, test cases, front-end assets, icons, and text.

**商业使用**：任何直接或间接以营利为目的的使用，包括但不限于：将本软件或其任何部分集成、嵌入、链接至任何营利性产品或服务；在商业环境（含公司内部生产系统）中部署；用于付费咨询、外包交付、培训材料或任何产生经济收益的场景。

**Commercial Use**: Any direct or indirect use for profit, including but not limited to: integrating, embedding, or linking the Software or any part thereof into any for-profit product or service; deploying it in a commercial environment (including internal production systems of companies); using it for paid consulting, contracted deliverables, training materials, or any scenario that generates economic benefit.

